# GRV98 leading-order parton densities: interpolation grid.
# M. Glueck, E. Reya, A. Vogt, Eur. Phys. J. C 5, 461 (1998) [hep-ph/9806404].
# Grid of the GRV98 authors' LO set as distributed with the GRV98PA interpolation routine
# (here transcribed from the DATA-statement version po_grv98lo, R. Engel 09/98).
# Layout: NX=68 ln(x) nodes, NQ=27 ln(Q2/GeV^2) nodes (0.8 .. 1e6 GeV^2); then six tables
# (x*u_v, x*d_v, x*(dbar-ubar), x*(ubar+dbar), x*s, x*g) each NX*NQ values with x fastest,
# stored divided by the smooth factors (1-x)^3 x^0.5, (1-x)^4 x^0.5, (1-x)^7 x^0.5, (1-x)^7 x^-0.2,
# (1-x)^7 x^-0.2, (1-x)^5 x^-0.2 respectively (see kinematics/GRV98LO.cc).
NX 68
NQ 27
